# The compiled core is a build output, not source.
#
# Committing it on every branch added a five-megabyte object to the history
# each time a crate below it changed — twelve revisions so far, none of them a
# release. It is built by `make wasm-core` for local work and CI, and committed
# only on the release tag the module is published from, which is the one tree
# `go get` ever fetches.
/core.wasm
